<title>UK: Parmalat sets 500 bln lire 4-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Parmalat sets 500 bln lire 4-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Italiano and Chase Manhatten International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PARMALAT FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PARMALAT SPA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.375     PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/NL/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
